{
  "set": "dwarf/core",
  "rev": 1,
  "style": "dwarf",
  "about": "The dwarf town's core set: whole buildings, each authored in the dwarf base palette (Deepforge hold). A town's clan comes from styles/settlement.json; recolour every part at placement with that clan's `swaps` from styles/dwarf.json (Deepforge has none). Every part is on the usual contract: layers 0-1 dirt, layer 2 the surface, the front to the south, every cell stored (air as air), points of interest declared or decorative twins, every walkable cell lit. The yard round each building is authored in red_sand with dead_bush: swap them for the land's ground and plant from the town's settlement entry (`ground`, `plant`).",
